<title>SRI LANKA: Bogawantalawa 1996 net up sharply.</title>
<headline>Bogawantalawa 1996 net up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Bogawantalawa Plantations Ltd for the 12 months ending 31 December, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			    1996		    1995</p>
<p>     Turnover	 1,329.91   vs	 1,041.89</p>
<p>     Net profit	 105.30   vs	    59.67</p>
<p>NOTE - Bogawantalawa Plantations Ltd is one of six privatised estate firms listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
